---
title: "MoodMap — the backends grammar"
type: app
---

# MoodMap

A daily check-in: pick an emotion, say how strong it is and what caused it.
Every stateful element of the 0.33.0 grammar appears here once.

::model[name=Entry owner=viewer]
- id: uuid pk
- date: date [required]
- entry: ref(Entry) [required]
- core: enum(Joy,Trust) [required]
- intensity: integer [required, min=1, max=10]
- note: textarea [max=500, sentences=1..4, prompt="What caused you to feel this way?"]
- level: range [min=1, max=10, labels="Barely felt it|All-consuming", levels="2|4|7|9"]
- reminder_time: string [default="20:00", pattern="^\d\d:\d\d$"]
- score: number = round(sum(emotions.weighted) / count(emotions), 2)
- boolean_field: boolean [default=false]
- emotions: list(Emotion)
::

::route[method=GET path=/_api/Entry returns=list(Entry) filter=date sort=date]
::

::route[method=GET path=/_api/Entry/month returns="aggregate(avg(score),max(score),min(score),count,streak(date) by month(date))"]
::

::flow[model=Entry]
:::step[title="Pick an emotion"]
Which feeling is closest?

::::picker[bind=entry.core tiers=3 layout=wheel emoji=false]
- Joy: Serenity · Joy · Ecstasy | info="Feeling content and at ease | Seeing an old friend"
- Trust: Acceptance · Trust · Admiration
::::
:::
:::step[title="What caused it?" repeat=true]
- note: textarea [max=500, sentences=1..4, prompt="What caused you to feel this way?"]
:::
::

::form[model=Entry]
- level: range [min=1, max=10, labels="Barely felt it|All-consuming", levels="2|4|7|9"]
::

::compute[name=daily_score expr="avg(entries.weighted)" source=/_api/Entry]
::

::when[bind=day.score op="<=" value=-8]
A hard day. Reach out to someone you trust.
::

::schedule[bind=preference.reminder_time tz=viewer title="MoodMap" body="How are you feeling today?" link=/log]
::
